      Li  0.3667005200  0.3667005200  0.3835411900
      Mg  0.8846043800  0.8846043800  0.8645454700
      Mg  0.1153956200  0.1153956200  0.1354545300
    &END COORD
    &KIND Li
      BASIS_SET DZVP-MOLOPT-SR-GTH
      POTENTIAL GTH-PBE-q3
    &END KIND
    &KIND Mg
      BASIS_SET DZVP-MOLOPT-SR-GTH
      POTENTIAL GTH-PBE-q10
    &END KIND
  &END SUBSYS
  &PRINT
    &FORCES ON
